        "abstract": "The behavior of local oscillator tubes and associated circuit elements under the complex conditions of heat flow can be treated analytically. By means of such an analytical treatment, local oscillators at frequencies up to and beyond 1000 mc may be stabilized methodically with conventional temperature-sensitive elements. The resultant frequency stability is generally satisfactory for most practical purposes.",
